      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 1974 design split Buruburu into five phases, each with about 943 homes, mostly two‑storey maisonettes and 3‑4 bedroom bungalows.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        20,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
