      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Buruburu’s modern architecture features white façades and striking orange tiled roofs, a hallmark of 1970s Kenyan housing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buruburu",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The estate’s development marked a shift from rental housing to home ownership via tenant purchase and mortgage programs.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
